# Detailed personal-record versions of the public runbooks. The public tree carries
# the summarized walkthroughs; these keep the full failure analysis and correction
# trails. Mirrors the public path layout so provenance is obvious.
# NOT version-controlled — PHOENIX Tier 2 rsyncs this to the external drive.
/internal/
# Working plan files from agent sessions — scratch, superseded once the work
# lands in a runbook + the ISA decision log. Same class as /ISA.md.
/Plans/
# Interceptor's `screenshot --save` writes to the CWD, which is this repo when a
# verification runs from here. Verification artifacts belong in ~/Downloads.
/interceptor-screenshot-*.png
